<title>COLOMBIA: Cementos del Valle Q1 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Cementos del Valle Q1 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first-quarter net profit of Colombia's largest cement maker, Cementos del Valle, rose to 8.13 billion pesos from 7.87 billion in the same period a year ago, the Securities Superintendency said.</p>
<p>Further information on the company's first-quarter performance was not immediately available. The firm belongs to the powerful Sindicato Antioqueno conglomerate.</p>
<p>((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
